# Used instead of the root .dockerignore when building deploy/railway/Dockerfile
# (BuildKit picks <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile). The root
# file leaves frontend/ out because the compose backend image doesn't need it;
# this image builds the frontend too.

# Secrets and runtime data never go into an image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
data/

# Git, environments, caches, editor and agent folders.
.git
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
.worktrees/
.superpowers/
.claude/
.agents/
.vscode/

# Rebuilt inside the image.
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
frontend/dist/

# Not needed at runtime.
docs/
tests/
*.md
